{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crash-landed on the floating islands of a mysterious gas giant planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmic Castaway is a Strategy Survival game in which you\u00a0must gather scarce resources, rescue and manage your crew, build your colony and defend against the hostilities of a foreign world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resource Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think fast. Food is a must if we want to survive and we are running against the clock. Buildings and objects can be crafted from the remaining key resources; Lumber, Stone, &amp; Ore. How those resources are utilized will play a key role in your eventual success or demise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infrastructure Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sawmills, mines, fishing docks, farms, windmills, boardings, bridges, defense turrets, and more. Strategically placed resource infrastructure will yield results longer. Improperly placed/manned defenses could see the collapse of your colony.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend the colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space engineers don\u2019t have much training in battle. Luckily for you, your robot sentry drone is up to the task! However, as the colony grows, you will require more advanced defense systems. Strategically place these defensive systems to protect what you built and to advance further in your quest to rebuild your starship and blast off to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From wreckage to refuge. With your crew, forge the way home.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694870?t=1748538442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/bdc6faaffae584e654a4c5d240ac1ee63a62181d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748538442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/533e77f6b4be48f8bf03f0ce7ffe476e1184a7e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748538442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694870/533e77f6b4be48f8bf03f0ce7ffe476e1184a7e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748538442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crash-landed on the floating islands of a mysterious gas giant planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cosmic Castaway is a Strategy Survival game in which you\u00a0must gather scarce resources, rescue and manage your crew, build your colony and defend against the hostilities of a foreign world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Resource Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think fast. Food is a must if we want to survive and we are running against the clock. Buildings and objects can be crafted from the remaining key resources; Lumber, Stone, &amp; Ore. How those resources are utilized will play a key role in your eventual success or demise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infrastructure Management:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sawmills, mines, fishing docks, farms, windmills, boardings, bridges, defense turrets, and more. Strategically placed resource infrastructure will yield results longer. Improperly placed/manned defenses could see the collapse of your colony.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend the colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space engineers don\u2019t have much training in battle. Luckily for you, your robot sentry drone is up to the task! However, as the colony grows, you will require more advanced defense systems. Strategically place these defensive systems to protect what you built and to advance further in your quest to rebuild your starship and blast off to safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From wreckage to refuge. With your crew, forge the way home.</p>","developers":["Vinciware"],"genres":[{"d